{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09107","headline":"寄皎然上人 · 韦应物","name":"寄皎然上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴兴老释子，野雪盖精庐。\n诗名徒自振，道心长晏如。\n想兹栖禅夜，见月东峰初。\n鸣钟惊岩壑，焚香满空虚。\n叨慕端成旧，未识岂爲疎。\n愿以碧云思，方君怨别余。\n茂苑文华地，流水古僧居。\n何当一游咏，倚阁吟踌躇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09107.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09107","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}